WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.576
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind primary sources of data.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:11.300
Interview: collects answers by talking to people. Photograph: records a visual

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:11.741
moment.

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:17.237
Newspaper: reports news and events. Questionnaire: collects written responses.

00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:20.318
Recording: stores captured sound or video.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.277
Collect a few harmless facts about classroom materials, NOT personal details. Make a

00:00:26.277 --> 00:00:30.964
paper chart with the terms Interview, Photograph and Newspaper; explain what each

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:31.355
means.
